      "kind": "input",
      "description": "Número centrado entre quitar y agregar.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-stepper\"><button aria-label=\"Quitar una playera talla M\">−</button><input type=\"number\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" value=\"2\" aria-label=\"Cantidad de playeras talla M\"><button aria-label=\"Agregar una playera talla M\">+</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-stepper{display:flex;height:46px}.ds-stepper button{font:500 12px/1.6 var(--sans,Inter,system-ui,sans-serif);transition:background-color .15s,color .15s,border-color .15s;flex:0 0 32px;padding:0;border:1px solid var(--control-line,#cbd1c5);background:var(--bg,#f7f8f6);color:var(--text,#1c1c1b);font-size:18px;line-height:1;cursor:pointer}.ds-stepper button:first-child{border-radius:5px 0 0 5px}.ds-stepper button:last-child{border-radius:0 5px 5px 0}.ds-stepper input{font:500 12px/1.6 var(--sans,Inter,system-ui,sans-serif);transition:background-color .15s,color .15s,border-color .15s;min-width:0;width:100%;max-width:none;border:0;border-block:1px solid var(--control-line,#cbd1c5);border-radius:0;background:var(--panel,#ffffff);color:var(--text,#1c1c1b);text-align:center;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;appearance:textfield}.ds-stepper input::-webkit-inner-spin-button,.ds-stepper input::-webkit-outer-spin-button{appearance:none;margin:0}.ds-stepper button:hover:enabled{background:var(--yellow,#e8fb5b);border-color:var(--control-hover-line,#8b9582)}.ds-stepper button:focus-visible,.ds-stepper input:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--focus,#59651b);outline-offset:4px;}.ds-stepper button:disabled{opacity:.45;cursor:default}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{transition:none!important;animation:none!important}}",
