      "kind": "card",
      "description": "Panel del asistente con cuerpo amplio y pie de acciones separado por una regla.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-panel\"><div class=\"ds-panel-body\"><h2>Tu pedido</h2><p>Revisa las prendas y las condiciones antes de calcular.</p></div><div class=\"ds-panel-footer\">Paso 3 de 4</div></section>",
      "css": ".ds-panel{font:500 12px/1.6 var(--sans,Inter,system-ui,sans-serif);background:var(--panel,#ffffff);color:var(--text,#1c1c1b);border:1px solid var(--line,#dfe3db);border-radius:10px}.ds-panel-body{padding:32px}.ds-panel h2{margin:0;font-size:16px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.5}.ds-panel p{margin:8px 0 0;color:var(--muted,#60655c)}.ds-panel-footer{padding:20px 32px;border-top:1px solid var(--line,#dfe3db);color:var(--muted,#60655c)}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-panel-body{padding:22px}.ds-panel-footer{padding:18px 22px}}",
      "refersTo": "panel"
    },
    {
      "name": "Ruta del asistente",
      "kind": "nav",
      "description": "Cuatro pasos con círculo amarillo activo, regla inferior y estados completados y futuros.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-progress\" aria-label=\"Pasos del planificador\"><ol><li><button class=\"ds-completed\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"ds-step-number\">1</span><span>Prenda</span></button></li><li><button type=\"button\" aria-current=\"step\"><span class=\"ds-step-number\">2</span><span>Tallas</span></button></li><li><button type=\"button\" disabled><span class=\"ds-step-number\">3</span><span>Revisión</span></button></li><li><button type=\"button\" disabled><span class=\"ds-step-number\">4</span><span>Tu tela</span></button></li></ol></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-progress{font:500 13px/1.6 var(--sans,Inter,system-ui,sans-serif)}.ds-progress ol{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);padding:0;margin:0;list-style:none;gap:8px}.ds-progress li{min-width:0}.ds-progress button{font:inherit;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;border:0;border-radius:0;background:transparent;width:100%;padding:12px 0;color:var(--muted,#60655c);border-bottom:2px solid var(--line,#dfe3db);cursor:pointer;transition:background-color .15s,color .15s,border-color .15s}.ds-progress button:disabled{opacity:1;color:#747c6e;cursor:default}.ds-progress button[aria-current]{color:var(--text,#1c1c1b);border-bottom-color:#7c872c}.ds-step-number{display:inline-grid;place-items:center;border:1px solid #bac2b2;width:27px;height:27px;border-radius:50%;font-size:12px}.ds-progress [aria-current] .ds-step-number{background:var(--yellow,#e8fb5b);color:var(--text,#1c1c1b);border-color:var(--yellow,#e8fb5b)}.ds-progress .ds-completed .ds-step-number{background:var(--raised,#f1f3ee);color:var(--text,#1c1c1b)}.ds-progress button:hover:enabled{color:var(--text,#1c1c1b)}.ds-progress button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--focus,#59651b);outline-offset:4px}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-progress button{flex-direction:column;gap:8px;align-items:start;font-size:12px;padding:8px 0 12px}.ds-step-number{width:24px;height:24px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-progress button{transition:none}}"
